#. type: TH
#: condinapt.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONDINAPT"
msgstr "CONDINAPT"

#. type: TH
#: condinapt.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional APT Package Installer"
msgstr "Pemasang Paket APT Bersyarat"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:7
msgid ""
"condinapt - plan and install APT packages from a conditional package list"
msgstr ""
"condinapt - merencanakan dan memasang paket APT dari daftar paket bersyarat"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:10
msgid ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] \\f[B]-l\\f[R] \\f[I]PACKAGE-LIST\\f[R] \\f[B]-c\\f[R] "
"\\f[I]CONFIG\\f[R] [\\f[I]OPTIONS\\f[R]]\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] \\f[B]-l\\f[R] \\f[I]PACKAGE-LIST\\f[R] \\f[B]-c\\f[R] "
"\\f[I]CONFIG\\f[R] [\\f[I]OPTIONS\\f[R]]\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:17
msgid ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] reads a Bash configuration and a package list, "
"evaluates package filters, checks package availability, groups selected "
"packages into APT transactions, and installs them.  It supports exact or "
"fallback versions, target releases, alternatives, conjunctions, mandatory "
"alternatives, queue separators, and a priority list.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] membaca konfigurasi Bash dan daftar paket, "
"mengevaluasi filter paket, memeriksa ketersediaan paket, mengelompokkan "
"paket terpilih ke dalam transaksi APT, dan memasangnya. Mendukung versi "
"pasti atau fallback, rilis target, alternatif, konjungsi, alternatif wajib, "
"pemisah antrean, dan daftar prioritas.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:21
msgid ""
"The configuration file is sourced as Bash and must be trusted.  Package "
"installation and any APT list refresh normally require suitable privileges."
msgstr ""
"Berkas konfigurasi akan di-load sebagai Bash dan harus dipercaya. Instalasi "
"paket dan penyegaran daftar APT biasanya memerlukan hak istimewa yang sesuai."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-l\\f[R], \\f[B]--package-list\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-l\\f[R], \\f[B]--package-list\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:25
msgid "Required package list."
msgstr "Daftar paket yang diperlukan."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-c\\f[R], \\f[B]--config\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-c\\f[R], \\f[B]--config\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:28
msgid "Required Bash configuration file containing filter variables."
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi Bash yang diperlukan berisi variabel filter."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-m\\f[R], \\f[B]--filter-mapping\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-m\\f[R], \\f[B]--filter-mapping\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:32
msgid ""
"Optional prefix-to-variable mapping.  Without it, filter prefixes are "
"interpreted directly as variable names."
msgstr ""
"Pemetaan awalan ke variabel yang opsional. Tanpanya, awalan filter akan "
"langsung diinterpretasikan sebagai nama variabel."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-P\\f[R], \\f[B]--priority-list\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-P\\f[R], \\f[B]--priority-list\\f[R] \\f[I]PATH\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:38
msgid ""
"Optional file containing one Bash regular expression per line.  Expressions "
"match the first package token on each package-list line.  Matching lines are "
"moved to priority queues with their filters and target releases preserved."
msgstr ""
"Berkas opsional yang berisi satu ekspresi reguler Bash per baris. Ekspresi "
"akan mencocokkan token paket pertama pada setiap baris daftar paket. Baris "
"yang cocok akan dipindahkan ke antrean prioritas dengan filter dan rilis "
"target tetap dipertahankan."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-C\\f[R], \\f[B]--check-only\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-C\\f[R], \\f[B]--check-only\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:48
msgid ""
"Evaluate filters and report relevant package names that are not installed.  "
"Return 1 and print a suggested \\f[B]apt install\\f[R] command when packages "
"are missing.  This mode checks package names only; it does not validate "
"requested versions or target releases.  An alternative expression is "
"satisfied when one branch is installed; if none is installed, every failed "
"branch may be reported and suggested.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Evaluasi filter dan laporkan nama paket terkait yang belum terpasang. "
"Mengembalikan 1 dan menampilkan saran perintah \\f[B]apt install\\f[R] jika "
"ada paket yang hilang. Mode ini hanya memeriksa nama paket; tidak "
"memvalidasi versi atau rilis target yang diminta. Suatu ekspresi alternatif "
"dianggap terpenuhi jika salah satu cabang sudah terpasang; jika tidak ada "
"yang terpasang, setiap cabang yang gagal dapat dilaporkan dan disarankan.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-s\\f[R], \\f[B]--simulation\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-s\\f[R], \\f[B]--simulation\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:54
msgid ""
"Plan the installation without installing packages.  Simulation always exits "
"with status 1.  It may still run \\f[B]apt-get update\\f[R] when the package "
"cache is absent or \\f[B]--force\\f[R] is used.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Rencanakan pemasangan tanpa benar-benar memasang paket. Simulasi selalu "
"keluar dengan status 1. Namun, tetap dapat menjalankan \\f[B]apt-get "
"update\\f[R] jika cache paket tidak ada atau \\f[B]--force\\f[R] digunakan."
"\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-f\\f[R], \\f[B]--force\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-f\\f[R], \\f[B]--force\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:59
msgid ""
"Run \\f[B]apt-get update\\f[R] before normal installation or simulation even "
"when \\f[B]/var/cache/apt/pkgcache.bin\\f[R] exists.  It has no effect in "
"check-only mode.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan \\f[B]apt-get update\\f[R] sebelum pemasangan atau simulasi normal "
"meskipun \\f[B]/var/cache/apt/pkgcache.bin\\f[R] sudah ada. Tidak "
"berpengaruh pada mode hanya-periksa.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-v\\f[R], \\f[B]--verbose\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-v\\f[R], \\f[B]--verbose\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:62
msgid "Show filter decisions and direct APT output."
msgstr "Tampilkan keputusan filter dan keluaran langsung dari APT."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-vv\\f[R], \\f[B]--very-verbose\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-vv\\f[R], \\f[B]--very-verbose\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:65
msgid "Show additional planning and priority-queue details."
msgstr "Tampilkan detail tambahan perencanaan dan antrean prioritas."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-x\\f[R], \\f[B]--xtrace\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-x\\f[R], \\f[B]--xtrace\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:68
msgid "Enable Bash command tracing."
msgstr "Aktifkan pelacakan perintah Bash."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-h\\f[R], \\f[B]--help\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-h\\f[R], \\f[B]--help\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:71
msgid "Display help and exit."
msgstr "Tampilkan bantuan dan keluar."

#. type: SH
#: condinapt.1:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "INPUT FILES"
msgstr "BERKAS MASUKAN"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:76
msgid ""
"The required configuration is a Bash file.  Scalar values compare by exact "
"string equality.  Indexed Bash arrays match when any element equals the "
"requested value."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi yang diperlukan adalah berkas Bash. Nilai skalar dibandingkan "
"dengan kesamaan string persis. Array Bash terindeks cocok jika salah satu "
"elemennya sama dengan nilai yang diminta."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DISTRIBUTION=\\[dq]bookworm\\[dq]\n"
"SYSTEM_TYPE=\\[dq]server\\[dq]\n"
"ENVIRONMENT=\\[dq]production\\[dq]\n"
"FEATURES=(web database)\n"
msgstr ""
"DISTRIBUTION=\\[dq]bookworm\\[dq]\n"
"SYSTEM_TYPE=\\[dq]server\\[dq]\n"
"ENVIRONMENT=\\[dq]production\\[dq]\n"
"FEATURES=(web database)\n"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter Mapping"
msgstr "Pemetaan Filter"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:86
msgid ""
"An optional mapping assigns short package-list prefixes to configuration "
"variables:"
msgstr ""
"Pemetaan opsional menetapkan awalan singkat pada daftar paket ke variabel "
"konfigurasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"d=DISTRIBUTION\n"
"st=SYSTEM_TYPE\n"
"env=ENVIRONMENT\n"
"feat=FEATURES\n"
msgstr ""
"d=DISTRIBUTION\n"
"st=SYSTEM_TYPE\n"
"env=ENVIRONMENT\n"
"feat=FEATURES\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:97
msgid ""
"An unmapped prefix is used as the variable name.  Missing variables have an "
"empty value.  Variable names must be valid Bash identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Awalan yang tidak dipetakan akan digunakan sebagai nama variabel. Variabel "
"yang tidak ada nilainya kosong. Nama variabel harus merupakan pengenal Bash "
"yang valid."

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package List"
msgstr "Daftar Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:100
msgid ""
"Each non-empty, non-comment line contains a package expression.  Text after "
"\\f[B]#\\f[R] is ignored.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris yang tidak kosong dan bukan komentar berisi ekspresi paket. "
"Teks setelah \\f[B]#\\f[R] akan diabaikan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:105
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vim\n"
"nginx +st=server\n"
"debug-tools -env=production\n"
msgstr ""
"vim\n"
"nginx +st=server\n"
"debug-tools -env=production\n"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Priority List"
msgstr "Daftar Prioritas"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:110
msgid ""
"Each non-empty, non-comment line is a Bash \\f[B]=\\[ti]\\f[R] regular "
"expression matched against the first package token in a package expression:"
"\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris yang tidak kosong dan bukan komentar adalah ekspresi reguler "
"Bash \\f[B]=\\[ti]\\f[R] yang dicocokkan terhadap token paket pertama dalam "
"ekspresi paket:\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:115
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\[ha]linux-.*\n"
"\\[ha]firmware-.*\n"
"\\[ha]dkms$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\[ha]linux-.*\n"
"\\[ha]firmware-.*\n"
"\\[ha]dkms$\n"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt.1:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "PACKAGE SYNTAX"
msgstr "SINTAKS PAKET"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:117
#, no-wrap
msgid "Versions"
msgstr "Versi"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]package=version\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]package=version\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:123
msgid ""
"Request an exact version.  If it is unavailable but another candidate "
"exists, install the candidate and emit a warning."
msgstr ""
"Meminta versi tertentu. Jika tidak tersedia namun ada kandidat lain, paket "
"kandidat akan dipasang dan peringatan akan ditampilkan."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]package==version\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]package==version\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:127
msgid ""
"Require an exact version during planning.  If it is unavailable, this "
"expression cannot be selected."
msgstr ""
"Memerlukan versi pasti saat perencanaan. Jika tidak tersedia, ekspresi ini "
"tidak dapat dipilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:130
msgid ""
"When an exact requested version is selected and installed, "
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] applies \\f[B]apt-mark hold\\f[R] to that package.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Jika versi pasti yang diminta dipilih dan dipasang, \\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] "
"akan menerapkan \\f[B]apt-mark hold\\f[R] pada paket tersebut.\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:130
#, no-wrap
msgid "Target Releases"
msgstr "Rilis Target"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:133
msgid ""
"Append \\f[B]\\[at]release\\f[R] to install through \\f[B]apt-get -t "
"release\\f[R]:\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan \\f[B]\\[at]release\\f[R] untuk memasang melalui \\f[B]apt-get -t "
"release\\f[R]:\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "linux-image-amd64 \\[at]bookworm-backports\n"
msgstr "linux-image-amd64 \\[at]bookworm-backports\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:141
msgid ""
"Entries for the same release are pooled into one release-specific queue.  "
"The \\f[B]\\[em]\\f[R] separator does not split target-release queues.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Entri untuk rilis yang sama akan dikelompokkan dalam satu antrean khusus "
"rilis. Pemisah \\f[B]\\[em]\\f[R] tidak memisahkan antrean rilis target.\\fR"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filter"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]+prefix=value\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]+prefix=value\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:146
msgid ""
"Include the package when the mapped scalar equals \\f[I]value\\f[R] or an "
"array contains it.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Sertakan paket ketika skalar yang dipetakan sama dengan \\f[I]value\\f[R] "
"atau array berisi nilai tersebut.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-prefix=value\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-prefix=value\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:150
msgid ""
"Exclude the package when the mapped scalar equals \\f[I]value\\f[R] or an "
"array contains it.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Kecualikan paket ketika skalar yang dipetakan sama dengan \\f[I]value\\f[R] "
"atau array berisi nilai tersebut.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:154
msgid ""
"Repeated positive filters with the same prefix are alternatives.  Positive "
"filters with different prefixes must each have at least one match:"
msgstr ""
"Filter positif yang berulang dengan prefix yang sama dianggap sebagai "
"alternatif. Filter positif dengan prefix yang berbeda masing-masing harus "
"memiliki minimal satu kecocokan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "editor +d=bookworm +d=trixie +st=desktop\n"
msgstr "editor +d=bookworm +d=trixie +st=desktop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:161
msgid ""
"The example selects Debian Bookworm or Trixie and also requires "
"\\f[B]SYSTEM_TYPE=desktop\\f[R].\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini memilih Debian Bookworm atau Trixie dan juga mensyaratkan "
"\\f[B]SYSTEM_TYPE=desktop\\fR.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:163
msgid "Group filters make the relationship explicit:"
msgstr "Filter grup memperjelas hubungan:"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]+{a|b}\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]+{a|b}\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:166
msgid "Include when at least one condition matches."
msgstr "Sertakan jika setidaknya satu kondisi terpenuhi."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]+{a&b}\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]+{a&b}\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:169
msgid "Include only when every condition matches."
msgstr "Sertakan hanya jika semua kondisi terpenuhi."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-{a|b}\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-{a|b}\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:172
msgid "Exclude when at least one condition matches."
msgstr "Kecualikan jika setidaknya satu kondisi terpenuhi."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]-{a&b}\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]-{a&b}\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:175
msgid "Exclude only when every condition matches."
msgstr "Kecualikan hanya jika semua kondisi terpenuhi."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:177
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Contoh:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:182
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"web-server +{st=server|st=web-server}\n"
"database-tools +{d=bookworm&st=server}\n"
"debug-tools -{env=production|st=minimal}\n"
msgstr ""
"web-server +{st=server|st=web-server}\n"
"database-tools +{d=bookworm&st=server}\n"
"debug-tools -{env=production|st=minimal}\n"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatives And Conjunctions"
msgstr "Alternatif dan Konjungsi"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]left || right\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]left || right\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:190
msgid ""
"During planning, select the first alternative whose filters pass and whose "
"required packages are installed or available from APT.  It is not a runtime "
"fallback: if the later \\f[B]apt-get install\\f[R] transaction fails, "
"another alternative is not tried.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Pada tahap perencanaan, pilih alternatif pertama yang filternya lolos dan "
"paket yang dibutuhkan telah terpasang atau tersedia dari APT. Ini bukan "
"fallback saat runtime: jika transaksi \\f[B]apt-get install\\fR berikutnya "
"gagal, alternatif lain tidak akan dicoba.\\fR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]left && right\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]left && right\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:194
msgid ""
"Require every expression in the alternative to pass filtering and "
"availability checks before adding them to the same installation plan."
msgstr ""
"Setiap ekspresi dalam alternatif harus lolos pemeriksaan filter dan "
"ketersediaan sebelum ditambahkan ke rencana instalasi yang sama."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:196
msgid "\\f[B]&&\\f[R] binds within each \\f[B]||\\f[R] alternative:\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]&&\\fR mengikat dalam setiap alternatif \\f[B]||\\fR:\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:199 condinapt-minios.7:201
#, no-wrap
msgid "exfatprogs || exfat-utils && exfat-fuse\n"
msgstr "exfatprogs || exfat-utils && exfat-fuse\n"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Alternatives"
msgstr "Alternatif Wajib"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:202
msgid ""
"A leading \\f[B]!\\f[R] marks the entire package expression as mandatory:\\fR"
msgstr "Awalan \\f[B]!\\fR menandai seluruh ekspresi paket sebagai wajib:\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:206
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"!essential-package\n"
"!preferred-package || fallback-package\n"
msgstr ""
"!essential-package\n"
"!preferred-package || fallback-package\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:213
msgid ""
"If no alternative can be selected because required packages are unavailable, "
"normal execution aborts.  A valid later alternative satisfies the mandatory "
"expression.  Filter-only exclusions do not trigger a mandatory-package "
"abort, and simulation reports the failure without aborting early."
msgstr ""
"Jika tidak ada alternatif yang dapat dipilih karena paket yang dibutuhkan "
"tidak tersedia, eksekusi normal akan dihentikan. Alternatif yang valid "
"berikutnya memenuhi ekspresi wajib. Pengecualian yang hanya berdasarkan "
"filter tidak memicu penghentian paket wajib, dan simulasi akan melaporkan "
"kegagalan tanpa menghentikan proses lebih awal."

#. type: SH
#: condinapt.1:213
#, no-wrap
msgid "QUEUES"
msgstr "ANTREAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:218
msgid ""
"A line containing only \\f[B]\\[em]\\f[R] closes the current normal-"
"repository queue.  Packages in one queue are installed in a single APT "
"transaction, and normal queues run sequentially.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Baris yang hanya berisi \\f[B]\\[em]\\fR menutup antrean repository-normal "
"saat ini. Paket dalam satu antrean akan diinstal dalam satu transaksi APT, "
"dan antrean normal dijalankan secara berurutan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:221
msgid ""
"Target-release entries are pooled separately by release.  Processing order "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"Entri target-release dikelompokkan secara terpisah berdasarkan rilis. Urutan "
"pemrosesan adalah:"

#. type: IP
#: condinapt.1:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "1."
msgstr "1."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:223
msgid "Priority normal-repository queue"
msgstr "Antrean repository-normal prioritas"

#. type: IP
#: condinapt.1:223
#, no-wrap
msgid "2."
msgstr "2."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:225
msgid "Priority target-release queues"
msgstr "Antrean target-release prioritas"

#. type: IP
#: condinapt.1:225
#, no-wrap
msgid "3."
msgstr "3."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:227
msgid "Normal queues"
msgstr "Antrean normal"

#. type: IP
#: condinapt.1:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "4."
msgstr "4."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:229
msgid "Remaining target-release queues"
msgstr "Antrean target-release yang tersisa"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:236
msgid ""
"The priority list removes matching expressions from their original queues "
"and preserves their complete filters, conditions, versions, and target "
"release.  Only the first package token is used for priority matching, so a "
"pattern that matches only a later \\f[B]||\\f[R] branch does not prioritize "
"the expression.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Daftar prioritas menghapus ekspresi yang cocok dari antrean asalnya dan "
"mempertahankan filter, kondisi, versi, dan target release secara utuh. Hanya "
"token paket pertama yang digunakan untuk pencocokan prioritas, sehingga pola "
"yang hanya cocok dengan cabang \\f[B]||\\fR berikutnya tidak akan "
"memprioritaskan ekspresi tersebut.\\fR"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt.1:236
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPERATING MODES"
msgstr "MODE OPERASI"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:237
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "Simulasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:241
msgid ""
"Simulation performs planning but no package installation.  It can update APT "
"list state and always exits 1, so its exit status is not a success indicator."
msgstr ""
"Simulasi melakukan perencanaan tetapi tidak melakukan instalasi paket. "
"Simulasi dapat memperbarui status daftar APT dan selalu keluar dengan status "
"1, sehingga status keluar tersebut bukan indikator keberhasilan."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:244
#, no-wrap
msgid "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map -s -v\n"
msgstr "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map -s -v\n"

#. type: SS
#: condinapt.1:245
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check Only"
msgstr "Hanya Periksa"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:253
msgid ""
"Check-only evaluates filters and checks package names against the installed "
"package database.  It skips \\f[B]apt-get update\\f[R] and ignores version "
"and target-release requirements.  An alternative is satisfied when any "
"branch is installed.  If none is installed, the report and suggested command "
"may contain every failed branch rather than one availability-selected "
"alternative.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"Mode hanya-periksa mengevaluasi filter dan memeriksa nama paket terhadap "
"basis data paket yang terpasang. Proses ini melewati \\f[B]apt-get "
"update\\f[R] dan mengabaikan persyaratan versi serta target-release. Sebuah "
"alternatif dianggap terpenuhi jika salah satu cabang telah terpasang. Jika "
"tidak ada yang terpasang, laporan dan perintah yang disarankan dapat memuat "
"semua cabang yang gagal, bukan hanya satu alternatif yang dipilih "
"berdasarkan ketersediaan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:256
#, no-wrap
msgid "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map -C\n"
msgstr "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map -C\n"

#. type: SH
#: condinapt.1:257
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr "STATUS KELUAR"

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:258
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]0\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]0\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:262
msgid ""
"Installation completed, help was displayed, or check-only found no missing "
"packages."
msgstr ""
"Instalasi selesai, bantuan telah ditampilkan, atau mode hanya-periksa tidak "
"menemukan paket yang hilang."

#. type: TP
#: condinapt.1:262
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\f[B]1\\fR"
msgstr "\\f[B]1\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:266
msgid ""
"Invalid input, missing files, package or APT failure, missing packages in "
"check-only mode, or completion of simulation mode."
msgstr ""
"Input tidak valid, file hilang, kegagalan paket atau APT, paket hilang pada "
"mode hanya-periksa, atau simulasi selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:272
msgid ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] has no implicit configuration, mapping, or package-"
"list paths.  The package list and configuration must be supplied "
"explicitly.  The mapping and priority list are optional but are used only "
"when their paths are supplied.\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]condinapt\\f[R] tidak memiliki konfigurasi, pemetaan, atau path daftar "
"paket secara implisit. Daftar paket dan konfigurasi harus diberikan secara "
"eksplisit. Pemetaan dan daftar prioritas bersifat opsional, namun hanya "
"digunakan jika path-nya disediakan.\\fR"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:274
msgid "Install a filtered list:"
msgstr "Instal daftar yang sudah difilter:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:277
#, no-wrap
msgid "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map\n"
msgstr "condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:280
msgid "Force an APT list refresh and install priority packages first:"
msgstr ""
"Paksa penyegaran daftar APT dan instal paket prioritas terlebih dahulu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:284
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map \\[rs]\n"
"  -P priority.list -f\n"
msgstr ""
"condinapt -l packages.list -c system.conf -m filters.map \\[rs]\n"
"  -P priority.list -f\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: condinapt.1:288
msgid ""
"\\f[B]apt\\f[R](8), \\f[B]apt-get\\f[R](8), \\f[B]apt-cache\\f[R](8), "
"\\f[B]condinapt-minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
msgstr ""
"\\f[B]apt\\f[R](8), \\f[B]apt-get\\f[R](8), \\f[B]apt-cache\\f[R](8), "
"\\f[B]condinapt-minios\\f[R](7)\\fR"
